# Source file for pip-compile/uv - run
#   uv pip compile requirements-dashboard.in -o requirements-dashboard.txt --python-version 3.11
# to regenerate requirements-dashboard.txt with every transitive dependency
# pinned. Kept separate from requirements.in / the Airflow image: that
# image pins sqlalchemy==1.4.x for Airflow's own ORM (see Dockerfile),
# while this service is free to run current sqlalchemy - no reason to drag
# fastapi/uvicorn into the Airflow container or fight that pin.
